dzn: Backport four Dozen fixes from Mesa's 26.3 branch

Mesa's staging/26.3 branch, after 26.3.1. Drop this patch when release.env
moves to a release that has them (26.3.2).

- 6a5238d2 dzn: Fix pooled descriptor set vk_object_base lifecycle.
  Resetting a descriptor pool finished every slot, including ones never
  allocated or already freed, and destroying a pool never finished its
  allocated sets. Placed by hand: Ika's inline-data windows sit where the
  upstream hunk expects the bindless branch.
- 99f97f0e dzn: Free the enhanced barrier allocation base. A barrier with
  only buffer or only image dependencies leaked its allocation on GPUs with
  Direct3D 12's enhanced barriers.
- d34de522 dzn: Advertise KHR_external_memory_capabilities and
  KHR_external_semaphore_capabilities, which Dozen already implements.
- a96104ad dzn: Fix collect_buffer barriers around vkCmdCopyQueryPoolResults,
  so query results copied without VK_QUERY_RESULT_WAIT_BIT, and resets and
  copies after them, are synchronized.

